summary:
  The watch's timer runs whether or not a live stream plays.

history:
  A panel widget sits idle for most of its life. The timer is bound to a
  live stream playing, so an idle, parked or stopped widget wakes for
  nothing.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StandWatch.qml

find:
          running: watch.watching

replace:
          running: true

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_stream_that_stands_is_handed_to_the_road_every_other_death_takes,
  which the gate runs first, and by tst_standwatch::test_nothing_ticks_until_a_live_stream_plays.
  Line-neutral.
